762..838 Comment "/// A list\'s entries and its tail summed at once: an entry\'s sum descends on"
839..917 Comment "/// the element code, the list code\'s field, but the tail\'s stands at the list"
918..994 Comment "/// code `ListL(a)` itself. The tail is below the value, and the value is no"
995..1029 Comment "/// parameter the fixpoint stages."
